      "writtenOn": "2025-08-18T13:33:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When would it make sense to reuse vs not reuse a menu? I\u0027m trying to understand whether true is a sensible default here. It seems like false would be better so that every menu is freshly built but perhaps I\u0027m misunderstanding.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 107,
