      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T09:02:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chromium has recently implemented caching of menu items to optimize the process of building menu items. Caching implementation is enabled by default in Chromium. Hence, We are trying to provide a way for OEMs to disable caching in case they are modifying menu items which need a freshly build menu everytime. Modified Documentation citing this.",
      "parentUuid": "79eee3df_8d15d5a4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 107,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 107,
